<h1>Look up a passage</h1>
<form id="search-form" action="/search/" method="get">
  <label for="q">Citation</label>
  <input id="q" name="q" type="text" size="40" placeholder="John 1:1-14">
  <button type="submit">Read</button>
</form>
<div id="search-result"></div>
<noscript><p>Looking up a passage uses JavaScript in your browser. The Daily Office pages can be read from the <a href="/office/">date list</a> without it.</p></noscript>
